---
// Component: ProcessSteps.astro
---
<!-- 8. PROCESS: HOW CCTV INSTALLATION WORKS (WIREFRAME BLOCK 8 - 4 STEPS) -->
  <section class="py-20 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
        <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/50 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/50">
          Professional Workflow
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight">
          How CCTV Installation Works
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
          From first enquiry to final handover: transparent, reliable, and zero fuss.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 relative">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="glass-box p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-blue-600 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-base mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/30">
              1
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Tell Us About the Property</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Property type, camera goals, storeys, access and existing equipment. Share your address or photos for an immediate initial estimate.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
            Initial Phone / Web Scope
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="glass-box p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-600 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-base mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-cyan-600/30">
              2
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Assessment and Quote</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Confirm blind spots, cable routes, storage needs and written inclusions. You receive a guaranteed fixed-price written proposal.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-400">
            Guaranteed Fixed Price
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="glass-box p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amber-600 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-base mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-amber-600/30">
              3
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Professional Installation</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Mount, cable, configure, test and clean up. Our licensed technicians arrive in fully equipped vans with all necessary tooling.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400">
            Tidy Cabling Guarantee
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="glass-box p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 relative flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-emerald-600 text-white font-black flex items-center justify-center text-base mb-5 shadow-lg shadow-emerald-600/30">
              4
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">Handover and Support</h3>
            <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
              Teach the customer, provide credentials and explain ongoing support. We ensure you feel 100% confident operating your new system.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
            Ongoing Local Assistance
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
